DTSTART:20261107T080000Z
DTEND:20261107T120000Z
SUMMARY:Moab Trail Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Moab Trail Marathon features 26 miles of exhilaration through scenic and unique landscapes. 2026 USATF Trail Half Marathon National Championships and Host of the Collegiate Trail Running Championships 2026. Multiple distance options available including Marathon\, Half Marathon\, 10K Adventure Run\, and Kids K Race.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kessel-run-ultra-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261107T060000Z
DTEND:20261107T100000Z
SUMMARY:Kessel Run Ultra
DESCRIPTION:Trail ultramarathon event located in North Fruita Desert\, Colorado featuring world-class single track trails with sweeping views of the San Juan Mountains and Colorado National Monument. All distances begin on fast\, flowing singletrack and progress to steep terrain on the Zippity-Do-Da Trail. Course elevations range from 5\,030' to 5\,541'. Event includes aid stations\, finisher's medal\, custom race shirt\, bib\, and BOCO Technical Trucker hat.
LOCATION:18 Road Parking\, Fruita\, CO (GPS: 39.31093\, -108.70360)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:colorado-24-hour-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261107T080000Z
DTEND:20261107T120000Z
SUMMARY:Colorado 24 Hour Run
DESCRIPTION:A scenic\, fully supported 1-mile dirt loop running event offering 6\, 12\, or 24-hour race options\, as well as relay team formats. Participants can run during the day and/or night with full aid stations\, hot food\, and post-race celebration. The event benefits Colorado Youth Outdoors nonprofit\, with fundraising opportunities available.
LOCATION:Colorado Youth Outdoors – Swift Ponds Campus\, Fort Collins\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
