BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:longmont-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont Turkey Trot is one of the fastest\, most scenic 10K and 2-mile courses. Participants can run\, roll\, or walk past the finish line with wheelchair division available for the 10K race. The event kicks off the holiday season with age group and gender divisions for awards.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, 4600 Clover Basin Dr\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:turkey-trek-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261121T083000Z
DTEND:20261121T123000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey Trek
DESCRIPTION:Turkey Trek is a unique holiday running event featuring multiple distance options with three interactive challenges: Eggnog Chug Challenge\, Hay Bale Hop Challenge\, and Fill Your Pie Hole Challenge. All participants receive a red heavyweight performance-blend hooded sweatshirt. The Half Turkey (13.1 miles) finishers earn a commemorative finisher mug. Proceeds benefit Community Table\, a local food bank serving Arvada and surrounding areas.
LOCATION:Long Lake Regional Park\, Arvada\, CO 80007
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
