UID:turkey-rock-trot-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey ROCK Trot 5k
DESCRIPTION:Plum Creek Church 22nd Annual Turkey ROCK Trot Presented by CORE - A Thanksgiving morning 5K family fun run/walk/stroll featuring live DJ at start line\, live music on course\, indoor health & wellness expo with 30+ vendors\, free kids dash\, awards ceremony\, and costume contest. All proceeds benefit the Help&Hope Center. FREE 1K Kids Dash at 8:30 AM sponsored by PR Youth Running.
LOCATION:Douglas County Event Center\, 500 Fairgrounds Drive\, Castle Rock\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
