BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mile-high-united-way-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Mile High United Way Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The 53rd Mile High United Way Turkey Trot is Denver's beloved Thanksgiving Day tradition featuring a 4-mile race/walk and 1-mile Lil' Gobbler Family Fun Run in Washington Park. The event includes a Family Fun Zone with games\, face painting\, and photos with Gobbles the Turkey. All proceeds support Mile High United Way's critical work providing early learning\, housing support\, and basic needs assistance to families in the community.
LOCATION:1700 E Louisiana Ave\, Denver\, CO 80210
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
