UID:colderboulder-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261025T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T080000Z
DTEND:20261205T120000Z
SUMMARY:COLDERBoulder
DESCRIPTION:Winter 5K race featuring 14 invitational races organized by pace\, an open race category\, a walking wave\, and virtual race option. All participants receive a medal. Top 3 finishers in each invitational race earn special Cold Medals. Race includes finish fest with burritos\, doughnuts\, coffee\, and hot cocoa.
LOCATION:CU Campus\, Boulder\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
